# Allow list for scripts/check-no-legacy-name.mjs: every place the old name "nemo" may still appear (format in the script header).

# References to the frozen Node repo (read-only reference for behaviour and fixtures), never to be renamed.
token Vibe/(Coding-Agent/)?nemo-cli
token /path/to/nemo-cli
token (from|Translated from) nemo-cli
token NEMO_NODE_REF
token scripts/nemo-leftovers\.allow
token Vibe/Nemo-ACD                      # the local folder keeps its name
file tools/golden-capture/**             # reads the Node repo; cannot regenerate the goldens after the rename (tests/golden/README.md)
file tests/agent-evals/adapters/node/**  # drives the Node NativeAgent, which still reads NEMO_HOME and nemoHome
file design/tui-prototype/**             # the owner's HTML prototype, copied unchanged (its sample code uses "nemo-session")
in tests/agent-evals/README.md NEMO_HOME
in tests/agent-evals/harness/selftest.js nemo-cli
in tests/golden/README.md (Node|NEMO_|nemo_home|loadNemoEnv|nemo-cli|nemo import)[^ ]*

# Legacy migration: `synt doctor` detects the old ~/.nemo and NEMO_* (names only), never reads them.
file crates/synthesis-app/src/doctor.rs
# Docs that explain the rename quote the old names (old -> new tables, migration steps).
in CLAUDE.md Nemo|NEMO[_.*]\S*|\.nemo|\bnemo\b
in docs/MIGRATION.md Nemo|NEMO[_.*]\S*|\.nemo|nemo\.(json|db)|nemocode|\bnemo\b|"nemo"
in docs/RELEASE.md NEMO_[A-Z_]*|nemo-acd   # nemo-acd: the old repo name (rename note, historical validation log)
in docs/specs/config.md Nemo|NEMO[_.*]\S*|\.nemo|nemo\.json|"nemo"
in tests/golden/README.md Nemo|NEMO[_.*]\S*|\.nemo|nemo\.json|nemocode-config|\bnemo\b|"nemo"

# The checker itself, this list, and the rename test harness wording.
file scripts/check-no-legacy-name.mjs
file scripts/nemo-leftovers.allow
in crates/synthesis-tui-render/tests/golden.rs (Nemo -> Synthesis|"nemo")

# History: past entries describe what was true then.
file CHANGELOG.md
file .github/release-maintainers.txt     # owner file, unchanged on purpose
